{"steam_appid":1650550,"steam_name":"Workshop Simulator","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1650550/445985/c1dc865c9d63c402f243219635f01785774b89d5/1751014173/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1646910596","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256877282/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1646910596","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1650550/ss_d73cff5b7be796c20ba68f0ee7209b9f7e3a1737.1920x1080.jpg?t=1726487010","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1650550/ss_27f1d43ea9cd3e9e23c258bf04fc1971d5f841a3.1920x1080.jpg?t=1726487010","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1650550/ss_884ec5a8d6b903318717e2c4d97d9bb40b87c50d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1726487010","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1650550/ss_36a9d9ca1c5514212fb5d401359528de6ebb0bea.1920x1080.jpg?t=1726487010","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1650550/ss_17673d47098dba0fb39a694a05e366fad0a307c3.1920x1080.jpg?t=1726487010"],"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Feel the joy of turning the old into pristine condition again</strong></h2><br>Can an innocent request from your grandma lead to a nostalgic trip down memory lane, helping you find out about your family's history? Workshop Simulator is a relaxing restoration simulator - take vintage items and give them a second life - the respect for the usefulness of every object, which in the hands of a specialist can become a small work of art.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1650550/extras/251d7fb543e4f07df1cf38cbc86a70c0.poster.avif?t=1726487010\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1650550/extras/251d7fb543e4f07df1cf38cbc86a70c0.webm?t=1726487010\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1650550/extras/fee53c7f734e1e14459d340bc0c080f2.poster.avif?t=1726487010\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1650550/extras/fee53c7f734e1e14459d340bc0c080f2.webm?t=1726487010\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Idyllic, comfy, and relaxing experience in highly detailed visuals</strong></h2><br>Workshop Simulator is more than a unique experience of transforming objects from ruined to brand new. The atmosphere, full of nostalgia and relaxation, together with the environment and gameplay, gives you a sense of warmth and calm remembrance.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1650550/extras/8f018f03d6317b3e4ced03ced4eae1cd.poster.avif?t=1726487010\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1650550/extras/8f018f03d6317b3e4ced03ced4eae1cd.webm?t=1726487010\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1650550/extras/88125af687a9dbc4eb30c31d74dd8492.poster.avif?t=1726487010\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1650550/extras/88125af687a9dbc4eb30c31d74dd8492.webm?t=1726487010\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Heart-warming Story - Exploring your family history through tinkering</strong></h2><br>Immerse yourself in an idyllic rural setting where you can explore the delights of tinkering in a workshop, but also discover the history of your family by interacting with unique family treasures, each with a different story to tell.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1650550/extras/7108c6502efe539639fbf5c1d76c484f.poster.avif?t=1726487010\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1650550/extras/7108c6502efe539639fbf5c1d76c484f.webm?t=1726487010\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1650550/extras/ad5f266ecbd5175006551035671e2ed5.poster.avif?t=1726487010\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1650550/extras/ad5f266ecbd5175006551035671e2ed5.webm?t=1726487010\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>immerse Yourself</strong></h2><br>Visit your beautiful, idyllic family farm and take in the midwestern country air - your tools await you by your workbench! Workshop Simulator allows you to repair and refurbish items  using a range of restoration mechanics such as disassembling, cleaning, sanding and painting.  The accompanying story will immerse you in the nostalgia of tinkering with your grandfather.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1650550/extras/bdeac54d40fb9d114d2527ecba923218.poster.avif?t=1726487010\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1650550/extras/bdeac54d40fb9d114d2527ecba923218.webm?t=1726487010\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1650550/extras/03a0f64cafde58c25aa885d898c5c364.poster.avif?t=1726487010\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1650550/extras/03a0f64cafde58c25aa885d898c5c364.webm?t=1726487010\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Any 4-thread CPU<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Geforce 750 GTX<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 12 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> yes</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Any 4-core CPU<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> High 30 FPS @ 1080p - GeForce 1070 GTX or AMD equivalent; Epic 60 FPS @ 1080p - GeForce 1080 GTX or AMD equivalent<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 12 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> yes</li></ul>","genres":["Indie","Simulation"],"developers":["INTERMARUM"],"publishers":["INTERMARUM"],"release_date":"10 Mar, 2022"}